SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 10 taxa with 2 partitions and 600 total sites (0% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	10	360	162	127	196	196	first
   2	DNA	10	240	114	80	126	126	second

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

SUBSTITUTION PROCESS
--------------------

Edge-linked-proportional partition model with separate substitution models and separate rates across sites

